IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BGLBAL.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT BAL-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-BAL-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS BAL-ACCT-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-BAL-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD BAL-FILE.
01 BAL-REC.
   05 BAL-ACCT-ID PIC X(12).
   05 BAL-LEDGER PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-AVAILABLE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-BLOCKED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 BAL-UPDATED PIC 9(08).
   05 BAL-SEQ PIC 9(12).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BAL-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-BAL-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-ACCT-ID PIC X(12).
01 LS-OUT.
   05 LS-LEDGER PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 LS-AVAILABLE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 LS-BLOCKED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 LS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 LS-UPDATED PIC 9(08).
   05 LS-SEQ PIC 9(12).
   05 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-ACCT-ID LS-OUT.
    MOVE 0 TO LS-LEDGER
    MOVE 0 TO LS-AVAILABLE
    MOVE 0 TO LS-BLOCKED
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-CURRENCY
    MOVE 0 TO LS-UPDATED
    MOVE 0 TO LS-SEQ
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BAL-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/acctbal.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-BAL-PATH
    OPEN INPUT BAL-FILE
    IF WS-BAL-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-ACCT-ID TO BAL-ACCT-ID
    READ BAL-FILE
    IF WS-BAL-ST = "00"
        MOVE BAL-LEDGER TO LS-LEDGER
        MOVE BAL-AVAILABLE TO LS-AVAILABLE
        MOVE BAL-BLOCKED TO LS-BLOCKED
        MOVE BAL-CURRENCY TO LS-CURRENCY
        MOVE BAL-UPDATED TO LS-UPDATED
        MOVE BAL-SEQ TO LS-SEQ
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO LS-RC
    END-IF
    CLOSE BAL-FILE
    GOBACK.
